<title>UK: German inland gas oil firms 60-70 pfennings.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil firms 60-70 pfennings.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.8656)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     36.50/36.70     19.56/19.67   35.70/36.10</p>
<p> BREMEN		36.70/36.70     19.56/19.67   35.70/36.10</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    36.80/37.00     19.72/19.83   36.00/36.40</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   37.30/37.50     19.99/20.10   36.60/37.10</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   37.50/37.80     20.10/20.26   36.70/37.10</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  38.50/38.70     20.64/20.74   37.70/38.10</p>
<p>German inland gas oil was 60-70 pfennigs stronger on Monday a reflecting the continued strong dollar and firmer IPE futures.</p>
<p>Some traders think prices have now reached the point at which buyers cannot countenance purchasing and that prices will have to ease if sellers wish to sell.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
